# ThankForge 🗺️

Welcome to **ThankForge** (MulțumescForge)! This is a lightweight, web-based tool designed for quick and minimal fantasy map drafting. 

The application is completely free, built using a custom HTML Canvas element, and hosted directly on Google Sites.

## 🔗 Try It Live
You can access and use the tool here:  
👉 **[https://google.com](https://google.com)**

## ✨ Features
* **Custom HTML Canvas:** A pure interactive drawing board to map out your world.
* **Smart Coloring:** 
  * Choose **Brown** to paint countries and landmasses.
  * Choose **Blue** to paint oceans and water bodies.
* **Text Tool:** Add custom text directly onto your canvas to name your regions.
* **Built-in Authentication:** Features a fully programmed, custom **Sign Up** system for user accounts.
* **No Upgrades:** 100% free tool with no paywalls.

